OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after train hits van on
OL,4,Acrossing
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after a train hit a van
OL,7,Fon a railway line.
OL,9,FThe incident happened on a crossing in
OL,10,FBurscough, West Lancashire, just after
OL,11,F15:00 BST.
OL,13,FBritish Transport Police (BTP) said a
OL,14,Fman who was in the van died at the
OL,15,Fscene, and two passengers on the Wigan
OL,16,FWallgate-Southport train suffered minor
OL,17,Finjuries.
OL,19,FA BTP spokesman said: "Enquiries are
OL,20,Fongoing to establish the full
OL,21,Fcircumstances of what happened."
